From: =?UTF-8?q?=E9=87=8E=E6=BC=AB=E6=A8=AA=E6=B1=9F?= <1399226280@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:54:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nvn: decode BC uploads before copying into unpacked textures

Keep CPU-decoded BC textures off the GPU block-copy paths and resolve sampled, attachment and clear views to their decoded Metal formats. Preserve the existing compatibility opt-in and native BC path.

Add production GPU regression coverage for uploads, reuploads, mip and array layout, all BC views, attachments and clears.

Upstream-Status: fork-only (declined seedds/nxnative#488)
Reason: Repair uploads and format views in the existing opt-in CPU BC path on GPUs without native BC sampling.
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#732
